<title>USA: CBOE to list LEAPS on Halliburton, Xilinx.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list LEAPS on Halliburton, Xilinx.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Wednesday it will list LEAPS (Long term Equity Anticipation Securities) on shares of Halliburton Co and Xilinx Inc on June 13.</p>
<p>The exchange said Halliburton LEAPS will expire in January 1999 and have strike prices of 70, 80 and 90.</p>
<p>Xilinx LEAPS will also expire in January 1999 and will have strikes of 35, 45 and 55, it said.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
